# Raw source photos pulled from 2GIS / Instagram (~24 MB). Not served by the site and
# re-creatable at any time with `npm run media`; the optimised derivatives the site
# actually serves are committed under public/media/opt and public/media/instagram.
public/media/gallery/

# Visual QA artefacts — text reports (*.md) are committed, while multi-MB screenshots,
# sub-agent scratch scripts and CLI dumps are not. The `**/` matters: some runs nest a
# second directory (verify/verify/...).
sheet-*.png
qa*/_tmp/
